svg-editor
==========

This project contains code adapted from svg-path-editor by Yann Armelin,
used under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

    svg-path-editor
    Copyright Yann Armelin
    https://github.com/Yqnn/svg-path-editor
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The adapted portions are:

  src/core/parse.ts       The command grammar table and tokenizer, from
                          `src/lib/path-parser.ts`. Rewritten to use sticky
                          regexes and to emit nodes rather than command
                          objects; the grammar table itself is a faithful
                          reading of the SVG 1.1 BNF and is kept as-is.

  src/core/serialise.ts   `formatNumber`, the shortest-exact-representation
                          number formatter.

  src/view/viewport.ts    `gridStepFor`, the decade-stepped adaptive grid,
                          from `refreshGrid`.

Each adapted function carries its own attribution comment at the point of use.

--

